# Lab-local values (not committed)

Copy to `docs/LAB_LOCAL.md` and fill in **your** lab. That file is gitignored.

| Concept | Your value |
|---------|------------|
| SIEM host (LAN IP or DNS) | `192.0.2.10` |
| SSH alias | `soc` |
| SSH user | `labadmin` |
| Agentic install dir on SIEM host | `/home/labadmin/Agentic_SOC` |
| Wazuh compose dir | `/home/labadmin/wazuh-docker/single-node` |
| Analyst UI | `http://192.0.2.10:8080/` |
| Wazuh dashboard | `https://192.0.2.10` |
| Manager API | `https://192.0.2.10:55000` |
| Indexer | `https://192.0.2.10:9200` |
| GitHub repo | `https://github.com/<your-org>/Agentic_SOC` |
| Wazuh API user / password | see your Wazuh install |
| Indexer user / password | see your Wazuh install |
| Discord webhook URL | Pop `.env` only — never commit |
| Discord bot token / channel / guild | Pop `.env` only — never commit |

Use these when following [`SETUP_GUIDE.md`](SETUP_GUIDE.md). Public pages (`README.md`, `docs/site/`) use placeholders only (`<SIEM_HOST>`, `$AGENTIC_SOC_HOME`, …).
